TEXT 0 536 Left 2 ;Buck converter: S1 switches 12 V at 100 kHz with 40 % duty (V2), D1 freewheels, L1 and C1
TEXT 0 560 Left 2 ;filter. Shown from 2 ms on, when the output has settled. Measured: the output voltage and its
TEXT 0 584 Left 2 ;ripple, the input and output power and the efficiency (PARAM). Right-click R1 > Plot power:
TEXT 0 608 Left 2 ;with cursors A and B one period (10 us) apart, the readout averages it like .meas pout.
